<title>USA: Lands' End Inc Q4 Jan 31 net up.</title>
<headline>Lands' End Inc Q4 Jan 31 net up.</headline>
<dateline>DODGEVILLE, Wis. 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.15		    $0.77</p>
<p> Net			 37,436		   25,787</p>
<p> Revs		     423,328		  399,475</p>
